    *   **UI Framework/Component Library:** Most dashboard applications use a UI library for consistent styling, pre-built components (buttons, forms, tables, charts, etc.), and responsiveness. Examples include:
        *   **Material-UI (MUI):** (`@mui/material`, `@emotion/react`, `@emotion/styled`) - Very popular and comprehensive.
